Plan: a layered Spring Boot 3 service. A JPA entity maps to the table, a validated request record is the input contract, a repository provides a derived query, and the controller returns the right HTTP status codes. H2 runs in memory for development. Moving to PostgreSQL only means changing the driver and the URL.

